			(property "Description" "CN3791-based MPPT solar Li-ion/LiPo charger module, 4-pin bare-board variant (silkscreen: 'CN3791 MPPT Module', pads labeled S+/S-/B-/B+). No JST connectors on this variant -- solder-in header pins only. Pad pitch assumed 2.54mm (standard, unconfirmed to fab tolerance). Charging spec per user-confirmed data: 12V/3S pack output, 2A max charge current, 12VDC solar input."
